@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Reviewer
actor "Editor (library staff)" as Editor
actor "Final Editor (director)" as Director
actor Administrator
actor "SMTP / Mailpit" as SMTP
rectangle "HCMUT Thesis Portal - weeks 1-6" {
  usecase "Save draft / submit PDF" as Submit
  usecase "Track / revise / resubmit" as Track
  usecase "Read metadata / preview PDF" as Read
  usecase "Accept / reject with reason" as Decide
  usecase "Edit metadata" as Edit
  usecase "Return to Editor with reason" as Return
  usecase "Confirm portal archive" as Archive
  usecase "Read approval history" as History
  usecase "Existing configuration" as Configure
  usecase "Deliver workflow email" as Notify
}
Student --> Submit
Student --> Track
Student --> Read
Student --> History
Reviewer --> Read
Reviewer --> Decide
Reviewer --> History
Editor --> Read
Editor --> Decide
Editor --> Edit
Editor --> History
Director --> Read
Director --> Return
Director --> Archive
Director --> History
Administrator --> Configure
SMTP --> Notify
note right of Return : Keeps academic decisions and PDF
note right of Archive : DSpace publication is separate.\nSigning integration remains pending.
@enduml
